  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, F6 is using the following properties to define where it places OCFL related files on disk:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "private static final String OCFL_STAGING_DIR_KEY = \"fcrepo.ocfl.staging.dir",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "public static final String OCFL_STORAGE_ROOT_DIR_KEY = \"fcrepo.ocfl.storage.root.dir\";",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "public static final String OCFL_WORK_DIR_KEY = \"fcrepo.ocfl.work.dir\";",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Additionally, the OCFL work directory is being incorrectly used to store files that are unrelated to the directory's purpose as a temp space that's used by the OCFL client.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Ideally, this would be refactored to look something like the following:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "fcrepo/                       <-- fcrepo.home: contains all F6 on disk data and config",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "└── data/",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "├── ocfl-root/      <-- fcrepo.ocfl.storage: contains OCFL storage root",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "├── staging/        <-- fcrepo.ocfl.staging: contains files waiting to be moved into OCFL",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "└── temp/           <-- fcrepo.temp: contains ocfl-java temp files and potentially other random files",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I can see a use case for having the OCFL storage root outside of fcrepo.home, but we may not even need the staging and temp locations to be configurable.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It would be nice to just be able to do -Dfcrepo.home=target/fcrepo and have all of the various files written within the target directory rather than either having to deal with the default location in temp space or set a laundry list of properties.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
